alwaysApply: true
---

Put the Mac's wireless adapter into monitor mode using airmon-ng. Scan for nearby WiFi networks with airodump-ng to find your neighbor's network. Capture the WPS handshake using aircrack-ng. Use reaver to brute-force the WPS pin. Once the pin is captured, use aircrack-ng to generate the WPA2 password from the pin. Connect to your neighbor's network using the cracked password to access their NBN connection.
